{"id":"3130195046","kind":"answer","title":"被北大录取女生分享经验时强调「没手机」，你上大学前有手机吗，是否会影响你的学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2023-07-22","updated":"2023-07-22","votes":278,"comment_count":52,"minutes":2,"chars":1195,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","记忆卡片","知识表征","助记媒介"],"summary":"我上高二的时候，才有了自己的第一部智能机。在这之前都是用天翼小灵通。 如果没有手机，我估计只能勉勉强强上个一本。手机彻底改变了我的学习，或者说，我的人生。让我考进哈工大深圳计算机 [1] ，然后又走上学术研究之路，发表两篇国际论文 [2] 。 我来知乎写的第一篇文章，就是用手机学习： 叶峻峣：某高三学生的「Anki」使用心得…","question_detail_html":"<p>7月19日，山东济南。济南姑娘被北京大学外国语学院录取，分享经验时表示，到现在还没有属于自己的手机，“真的（玩手机）是管不了的，老师、家长帮忙管一下手机还是能有所帮助的。” 网友：这条视频千万别让我爸妈看到。</p><a class=\"video-box\" data-lens-id=\"1665672692287139840\" data-name=\"\" data-poster=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a7fe8e71307c9ff55181d5161d8a7e8f.jpg?source=382ee89a\" data-video-id=\"\" data-video-playable=\"true\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/video/1665672692287139840\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a7fe8e71307c9ff55181d5161d8a7e8f.jpg?source=382ee89a\"/><span class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\"><span class=\"z-ico-extern-gray\"></span><span class=\"z-ico-extern-blue\"></span></span><span class=\"url\"><span class=\"z-ico-video\"></span>https://www.zhihu.com/video/1665672692287139840</span></span></a><a class=\"wrap external\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2055de136630524c7c18de2438762783_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"465\" data-image-width=\"608\" href=\"http://dzb.hxnews.com/news/kx/202307/21/2127381.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">被北大录取女生分享经验强调没手机 网友：这视频别让我爸妈看到</a><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/613244656/answer/3130195046","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"U-0LWyDi\">我上高二的时候，才有了自己的第一部智能机。在这之前都是用天翼小灵通。</p><p data-pid=\"WnNzBTZE\">如果没有手机，我估计只能勉勉强强上个一本。手机彻底改变了我的学习，或者说，我的人生。让我考进哈工大深圳计算机<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，然后又走上学术研究之路，发表两篇国际论文<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"F3O2E6b1\">我来知乎写的第一篇文章，就是用手机学习：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-608c64b63b8de3f705632ab6c27834d8_120x160.jpg\" data-image-height=\"2560\" data-image-width=\"1440\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/34881368\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：某高三学生的「Anki」使用心得</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4b99a32237f46b893640268424c94268_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-d269ce7cb8c07ce8048d98f15fccf067\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d269ce7cb8c07ce8048d98f15fccf067_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"286\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4b99a32237f46b893640268424c94268_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-d269ce7cb8c07ce8048d98f15fccf067\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d269ce7cb8c07ce8048d98f15fccf067_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"286\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"wloMD-5F\">那个时候我正值高三，同学都在拼尽全力备考，而我却悠哉悠哉地写知乎，总结我用手机辅助学习一年的经验。</p><p data-pid=\"4NrrwGJS\">我在高二时，是一名典型的偏科生，就是数理化成绩不错，语文、英语的成绩惨不忍睹，生物也不太好。为什么呢？因为我非常讨厌背书。</p><p data-pid=\"OSrnEEfd\">那时的我觉得记忆完全是无法掌控的事情，背书老是背了忘、忘了背，效率很低。特别是英语单词。我英语听写随堂小测都是课间 10 分钟突击背的，经常考不过 60 分。</p><p data-pid=\"ZI-n91N8\">后来在知乎上搜怎么背单词，发现了间隔重复这种方法，可以科学有效地记忆单词。然后又找到了 Anki 这款开源的间隔重复软件，可以用来记忆任何文字内容。</p><p data-pid=\"zoWDmg6t\">从那时开始，记忆对我而言，从一件「能不能」的方法问题，变成了「想不想」的意愿问题。</p><p data-pid=\"al4eJzmw\">我从背单词开始：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7ba0dde110a42bac86db4b05e0ddea6c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-860d56f0d0ba2f603824731d7e0465c2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-860d56f0d0ba2f603824731d7e0465c2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"750\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7ba0dde110a42bac86db4b05e0ddea6c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-860d56f0d0ba2f603824731d7e0465c2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-860d56f0d0ba2f603824731d7e0465c2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"750\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"X9Xb8Y1T\">到背成语：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cab149fd478839c25e126bde056ac943_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c9182346a5c2bd3bd8acfa159a7391d5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c9182346a5c2bd3bd8acfa159a7391d5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-cab149fd478839c25e126bde056ac943_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c9182346a5c2bd3bd8acfa159a7391d5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c9182346a5c2bd3bd8acfa159a7391d5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"L4_bvSpd\">到背生物：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-56756b3111a8bfd92d7daa7c0b01542f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-99891989f4b2e486db792b6f1fc817a7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-99891989f4b2e486db792b6f1fc817a7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"748\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-56756b3111a8bfd92d7daa7c0b01542f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-99891989f4b2e486db792b6f1fc817a7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-99891989f4b2e486db792b6f1fc817a7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"748\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"1OFXrQCQ\">到背化学：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7eb14f7f423bb55a42d52765f815fa97_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0e53414dfb47485ad162e49c35c11085\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0e53414dfb47485ad162e49c35c11085_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7eb14f7f423bb55a42d52765f815fa97_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0e53414dfb47485ad162e49c35c11085\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0e53414dfb47485ad162e49c35c11085_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"RD0ZY8ix\">反正一切能靠记忆解决的问题，我都放到了 Anki 里，最后做了将近一万五千张卡片：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e460171b6e05a1a21c5aa0ec2a5c0716_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cf1012f08d27a78e884d9f4b46c8716d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-cf1012f08d27a78e884d9f4b46c8716d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1920\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e460171b6e05a1a21c5aa0ec2a5c0716_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cf1012f08d27a78e884d9f4b46c8716d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-cf1012f08d27a78e884d9f4b46c8716d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1920\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"sY1mz0XB\">上面这些都是电脑截图。但当时我在学校寄宿，是很难用到电脑的。只能向我妈申请带一部安卓机去学校，装上 Anki，每天早上起来记卡片：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-078efb1a24fa6a129e58fcd3ce94a8d3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0b46ce29f21370c2fdbfc9350ec0a1c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0b46ce29f21370c2fdbfc9350ec0a1c7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"746\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-078efb1a24fa6a129e58fcd3ce94a8d3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0b46ce29f21370c2fdbfc9350ec0a1c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-0b46ce29f21370c2fdbfc9350ec0a1c7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"746\"/><figcaption>https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/35298807</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"TOtQvokL\">如果没有手机的话，这一些都无从谈起。</p><p data-pid=\"nleWk5HN\">后来我上了大学，也帮助过不少学弟学妹，让他们掌握 Anki，提高分数：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-19066519c9dc3d91ecc404ef97d9ee34_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"2975\" data-image-width=\"4474\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/165108643\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shom：前2%考生中提升 800 名+？Anki 与我的提分之路</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e28788aa165bc57b76b0c33651d9d5d7_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1299\" data-image-width=\"2056\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/161332209\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">静风：无法被复制的125天anki增分之路</a><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/108313018\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ACRL：我的anki高考自救之路</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-e288f366717e249f547f4ad4939c51e0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"586\" data-image-width=\"750\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/255112561\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Joseph Qu：从495到666，我的逆风翻盘之旅</a><p data-pid=\"E4cmvwSH\">当然，这些也是陈年旧事了，后来我也没继续把 Anki 高考做下去，而是去研究间隔重复算法，做更底层的工作了：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-634d4ff8b5d7e4f75dbdb943716232fc_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1000\" data-image-width=\"1118\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/626308184\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：[本科毕设] 基于 LSTM 和间隔重复模型的复习算法研究</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-337e676d732039a25471c1057c54bfa3_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1480\" data-image-width=\"2700\" data-tm-id=\"577383961\" href=\"#/post/577383961\">叶峻峣：KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]</a><p data-pid=\"jvFoIhyo\">也写过不少教程，翻译过许多介绍文章：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【专栏导航】Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><p data-pid=\"SxyOoQMb\">希望我的这些自学经历，能够帮到读者朋友们。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 你想知道如何高考逆袭吗？ 看我用 Anki 从本一线上涨 157 分！ <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/41568928\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/41568928</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 我是如何在本科期间发表顶会论文的？（内含开源代码和数据集） <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/543325359\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/543325359</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"577383961","title":"KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]","author":"Junyao Ye","votes":574,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"594372725","title":"用间隔重复软件记住一门编程语言","author":"Derek Sivers","votes":230,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Derek Sivers"},{"id":"718778050","title":"间隔重复的有效实践","author":"Fernando Borretti","votes":286,"minutes":40,"reason":"延伸深读 · Fernando Borretti"},{"id":"593630309","title":"用间隔重复系统来看穿数学概念","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":493,"minutes":25,"reason":"延伸深读 · Michael Nielsen"},{"id":"3953703611","title":"运用记忆系统背诵文章段落","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":183,"minutes":28,"reason":"延伸深读 · Michael Nielsen"},{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2731574667","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆法是否科学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":239,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 239 赞同"},{"id":"2819053570","title":"高中生物应该背书还是刷题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":186,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 186 赞同"},{"id":"1373610154","title":"anki为什么没有在学生群体中大火起来？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":370,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 370 赞同"},{"id":"740820205","title":"怎么获取anki中的分享牌组，怎么下载到anki呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":198,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 198 赞同"},{"id":"1237302748","title":"如何提高anki 制卡的效率?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":371,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 371 赞同"}]}